text.paragraph:
Each 1 mL of aqueous solution in the 2 mL single-dose vial contains

  Active:ondansetron 2 mg as ondansetron hydrochloride dihydrate;

  Inactives:sodium chloride 9.0 mg, USP; citric acid monohydrate 0.5 mg, USP; 0.25 mg sodium citrate dihydrate, USP and Water for Injection, USP q.s.

Each 1 mL of aqueous solution in the 20 mL multidose vial contains

  Active:ondansetron 2 mg as ondansetron hydrochloride dihydrate; Preservatives: methylparaben 1.2 mg, NF and propylparaben 0.15 mg, NF;

  Inactives:sodium chloride 8.3 mg, USP; citric acid monohydrate 0.5 mg, USP; sodium citrate dihydrate 0.25 mg, USP and Water for Injection, USP q.s.
